# atmosphera keyd include — neutral stub
# This file is written to /etc/keyd/atmosphera when the user has NOT
# opted into any environment. It defines no bindings; keyd loads it
# but does nothing. `atmosphera-bindings-apply` replaces its contents
# with the real swap rules when the user picks an environment.
#
# NOTE: This file has NO [ids] section — included files must not
# have one (per keyd(1) File Inclusion limitations).
